< {"id":"ada72cd6-a4ff-492a-a41d-c5ee8a9f766b","result":{"thread":{"id":"019e2fa3-65fc-7381-a85d-304bffcc8f7b","sessionId":"019e2fa3-65fc-7381-a85d-304bffcc8f7b","forkedFromId":null,"preview":"你正在 DeepSeekX app-server cache benchmark 的第 1 轮。workspace 为空。\n这次是 2 轮 smoke test，不跑正式全量 benchmark；不要求 10,000 行停止条件，\n但最终第 2 轮后必须有可打开网站、报告和可复现启动命令。\n\n请构建一个真实可运行的网页产品原型：\n“Revenue Command Center”，面向客户成功、收入运营和支持负责人，用于发现续约、\n账单、工单、产品使用和事件风险。\n\n第 1 轮目标：建立可运行项目骨架和首个完整产品切片。\n\n要求：\n\n1. 先检查 workspace，然后创建清晰的静态 Web 项目结构。\n2. 使用原生 HTML/CSS/JS 或轻量 Node，不要安装大型框架。\n3. 页面必须包含：\n   - 顶部业务总览指标；\n   - 账户风险列表；\n   - 至少 3 个 coherent domains，例如 renewals、billing、support、usage、incidents；\n   - 搜索、筛选、详情切换或状态更新等真实交互；\n   - 空状态、错误状态或高风险状态展示。\n4. 数据要在项目内结构化维护，不要只写死在 DOM 文本里。\n5. 添加本地验收脚本，例如 `npm test` 或 `node scripts/validate.mjs`，检查关键文件、\n   数据字段、DOM 文本和核心业务规则。\n6. 提供启动入口，最好是 `npm start`，服务必须绑定 `0.0.0.0:5173`。\n7. 实际运行验证命令，必要时修复失败。\n8. 最后报告：创建了哪些文件、验证命令结果、first-party 行数估计、启动命令、\n   预览 URL `http://localhost:5173`、第 2 轮建议。\n\n约束：\n\n- 不读取或打印任何 API key、`.env` 或凭据。\n- 不用脚本批量生成 filler code。\n- 不要只做占位 demo；页面要能被用户实际体验。\n- 保持文件适中，避免把所有逻辑放进一个巨大文件。","ephemeral":false,"modelProvider":"deepseek","createdAt":1778915698,"updatedAt":1778915698,"status":{"type":"idle"},"path":"/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/deepseekx-home/sessions/2026/05/16/rollout-2026-05-16T07-14-58-019e2fa3-65fc-7381-a85d-304bffcc8f7b.jsonl","cwd":"/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace","cliVersion":"0.131.0-deepseekx.2","source":"vscode","threadSource":null,"agentNickname":null,"agentRole":null,"gitInfo":null,"name":null,"turns":[{"id":"019e2fa3-6611-75b3-a4b4-77c5da9b8a36","items":[{"type":"userMessage","id":"item-1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你正在 DeepSeekX app-server cache benchmark 的第 1 轮。workspace 为空。\n这次是 2 轮 smoke test，不跑正式全量 benchmark；不要求 10,000 行停止条件，\n但最终第 2 轮后必须有可打开网站、报告和可复现启动命令。\n\n请构建一个真实可运行的网页产品原型：\n“Revenue Command Center”，面向客户成功、收入运营和支持负责人，用于发现续约、\n账单、工单、产品使用和事件风险。\n\n第 1 轮目标：建立可运行项目骨架和首个完整产品切片。\n\n要求：\n\n1. 先检查 workspace，然后创建清晰的静态 Web 项目结构。\n2. 使用原生 HTML/CSS/JS 或轻量 Node，不要安装大型框架。\n3. 页面必须包含：\n   - 顶部业务总览指标；\n   - 账户风险列表；\n   - 至少 3 个 coherent domains，例如 renewals、billing、support、usage、incidents；\n   - 搜索、筛选、详情切换或状态更新等真实交互；\n   - 空状态、错误状态或高风险状态展示。\n4. 数据要在项目内结构化维护，不要只写死在 DOM 文本里。\n5. 添加本地验收脚本，例如 `npm test` 或 `node scripts/validate.mjs`，检查关键文件、\n   数据字段、DOM 文本和核心业务规则。\n6. 提供启动入口，最好是 `npm start`，服务必须绑定 `0.0.0.0:5173`。\n7. 实际运行验证命令，必要时修复失败。\n8. 最后报告：创建了哪些文件、验证命令结果、first-party 行数估计、启动命令、\n   预览 URL `http://localhost:5173`、第 2 轮建议。\n\n约束：\n\n- 不读取或打印任何 API key、`.env` 或凭据。\n- 不用脚本批量生成 filler code。\n- 不要只做占位 demo；页面要能被用户实际体验。\n- 保持文件适中，避免把所有逻辑放进一个巨大文件。\n","text_elements":[]}]},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-2","text":"Workspace is empty. Building the Revenue Command Center from scratch.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-3","text":"Now the static file server:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-4","text":"Now the data layer — structured mock data across 5 domains:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-5","text":"Now the CSS — dark dashboard theme:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-6","text":"Now the utility helpers:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-7","text":"Now the component renderer:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-8","text":"Now the main application controller:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-9","text":"Now the HTML shell:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-10","text":"Now the validation script:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-11","text":"Now running the validation:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-12","text":"Two real failures and one false positive. The `password` hit is from an incident ticket title (\"password reset\"), and the charset check needs case adjustment. Let me fix both the validation and the loading text.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-13","text":"All 87 checks pass. Now let me start the server and verify it serves correctly:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-14","text":"The server file has trailing template markers. Let me check and fix:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-15","text":"Clean. Now starting the server:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-16","text":"Server is live on port 5173, all endpoints return 200. Now let me count lines and finalize:","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-17","text":"Round 1 complete. Here's the summary.\n\n## Files Created (9 files, 1,313 first-party lines)\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| [package.json](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/package.json) | 13 | Scripts for `npm start` and `npm test` |\n| [server.mjs](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/server.mjs) | 40 | Zero-dependency Node HTTP server, binds `0.0.0.0:5173` |\n| [public/index.html](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/index.html) | 70 | HTML shell with metrics, toolbar, account list, and 3 states (loading, empty, error) |\n| [public/css/styles.css](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/css/styles.css) | 344 | Dark dashboard theme, CSS custom properties, responsive layout |\n| [public/js/data.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/data.js) | 164 | Structured data: 12 accounts, 8 renewals, 8 invoices, 10 tickets, 8 usage records, 5 incidents across 5 domains |\n| [public/js/utils.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/utils.js) | 71 | Formatting, filtering, scoring helpers |\n| [public/js/components.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/components.js) | 184 | UI rendering: metrics row, account rows, detail panels, empty/error states |\n| [public/js/app.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/app.js) | 209 | App controller: state management, event binding, filter/search/detail interactions |\n| [scripts/validate.mjs](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/scripts/validate.mjs) | 217 | 87 assertions across 8 phases |\n\n## Validation Results\n\n`npm test` — **87 passed, 0 failed** across these phases:\n- File inventory (9 files present)\n- package.json scripts correctness\n- Server config (0.0.0.0:5173, charset)\n- HTML structure (title, scripts, a11y, state containers)\n- Data structure (6 tables, all required fields present)\n- Business rules (minimum record counts, risk distribution, health score spread)\n- CSS (custom properties, accent colors, responsive, state styles)\n- Security (no API keys, no credential leaks)\n\n## What the Page Delivers\n\n5 coherent domains — renewals, billing, support, usage, incidents — each with structured records and risk indicators. The account list shows health scores, risk badges, domain-specific risk pills, and expandable detail panels with per-domain breakdowns. Interactions include text search, risk-level dropdown, domain filter dropdown, quick-filter chips (toggle on/off), click-to-expand detail panels, and Escape to close.\n\n## Start Commands\n\n```\nnpm start        → http://localhost:5173\nnpm test         → 87 validation checks\n```\n\n## Round 2 Suggestions\n\n- Add time-series sparklines to metrics cards (usage trend, ticket volume over time)\n- Add \"acknowledge\" or \"assign\" action buttons on tickets/incidents with state mutation\n- Add a summary/detail toggle that renders a compact table view vs. the card view\n- Persist filter state in URL query params for shareable views\n- Wire the health score bar clicks to filter by that account's domain risks","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null}],"itemsView":"full","status":"completed","error":null,"startedAt":1778915698,"completedAt":1778916569,"durationMs":871002}]},"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","modelProvider":"deepseek","serviceTier":null,"cwd":"/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace","instructionSources":[],"approvalPolicy":"never","approvalsReviewer":"user","sandbox":{"type":"dangerFullAccess"},"permissionProfile":{"type":"disabled"},"activePermissionProfile":null,"reasoningEffort":"high"}}
> {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "9ad6ba4e-013d-433f-a726-f3f3ab60395c", "method": "turn/start", "params": {"threadId": "019e2fa3-65fc-7381-a85d-304bffcc8f7b", "input": [{"type": "text", "text": "你正在同一个 DeepSeekX app-server thread 中继续第 2 轮，也是本次 2 轮 smoke\nbenchmark 的最后一轮。请先阅读当前 workspace，不要假设固定结构。\n\n第 1 轮实际状态：\n\n- 项目名：Revenue Command Center。\n- 文件：package.json、server.mjs、public/index.html、public/css/styles.css、\n  public/js/data.js、public/js/utils.js、public/js/components.js、public/js/app.js、\n  scripts/validate.mjs。\n- `npm test` 已通过：87 passed, 0 failed。\n- first-party line count：1313 行，9 个文件。\n- 启动入口：`npm start`，server.mjs 已绑定 `0.0.0.0:5173`。\n- 当前页面包含指标、账户风险列表、renewals/billing/support/usage/incidents、\n  搜索、筛选、详情面板、空状态和错误状态。\n\n本轮目标：在不跑全量 10k 行的前提下，把项目打磨到“用户可以打开体验”的最终\n2 轮 smoke 产物，并留下可复现报告。\n\n请完成：\n\n1. 移除外部网络资源依赖，特别是 Google Fonts 或任何远程资源；页面必须离线可渲染。\n2. 增加一个更完整的最终产品切片，至少包含以下两类：\n   - 行动队列/next best actions：把续约、账单、支持、使用、事件风险综合成可执行任务；\n   - 业务报告或风险剧本：展示每个高风险账户的推荐动作、owner、due date、影响金额。\n3. 增加真实交互：例如 owner/status 筛选、action 完成/暂缓状态、导出文本、报告标签切换，\n   或详情面板里的 playbook 选择。交互必须实际改变页面状态。\n4. 增加最终报告页或项目内说明文件，例如 `public/report.html` 或 `REPORT.md`，记录：\n   - 本次 2 轮 smoke benchmark 的目标；\n   - 如何启动网站；\n   - 如何运行验证；\n   - 已实现功能；\n   - 未达到正式 10k 行 benchmark 的说明和下一轮建议。\n5. 扩展 `scripts/validate.mjs`，验证新增功能、离线资源约束、报告文件、启动脚本。\n6. 实际运行 `npm test`，必要时修复失败。\n7. 最后启动或说明启动命令：`npm start`，用户可通过 `http://localhost:5173` 打开。\n8. 最终报告里写清楚：修改文件、验证结果、first-party 行数估计、启动命令、URL、剩余风险。\n\n约束：\n\n- 不读取或打印任何 API key、`.env` 或凭据。\n- 不使用大型框架，不安装不必要依赖。\n- 不用脚本批量生成 filler code。\n- 保持代码组织清楚，新增逻辑尽量拆到合适模块。\n- 这是最后一轮，请确保网站能打开、验证能通过、报告存在。\n", "textElements": []}], "cwd": "/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace", "approvalPolicy": "never", "sandboxPolicy": {"type": "dangerFullAccess"}, "effort": "high"}}
