< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"28b0e247-89ec-4b27-98f9-c5fcab29bc6a","text":"Round 2 complete. Here's the final summary.\n\n## Changes Made (Round 2)\n\n**Modified files** — 6 files rewritten or extended:\n\n- [index.html](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/index.html) — Removed Google Fonts links; restructured into 3 tab panels (Dashboard, Actions, Playbook); added actions toolbar with owner/status/domain filters + export button; added playbook account filter; badge updated to \"Round 2\"; script order fixed (utils before data)\n- [data.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/data.js) — Added 6 risk-response playbooks (Executive Save, Engagement Recovery, Payment Recovery, P1 Escalation, Adoption Rescue, Incident Response); added `buildActions()` deriving a concrete task queue from all 5 domains; added `updateActionStatus()`, `getPlaybooksForAccount()`, and exports\n- [components.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/components.js) — Added `renderActionsTable()`, `renderPlaybookCards()`, `renderExportText()`, `getActionOwners()`, `getPlaybookAccountOptions()`\n- [app.js](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/js/app.js) — Rewritten with tab switching, action complete/defer/undo mutations, owner/status/domain filters, export toggle, playbook rendering with account filter\n- [styles.css](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/public/css/styles.css) — Removed Google Font references, replaced with system-native font stack; added ~200 lines for tab nav, action table, playbook cards, domain dots, action buttons, export area\n- [validate.mjs](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/scripts/validate.mjs) — Added 5 new phases (9–13): offline compliance, Round 2 HTML features, data features, CSS features, project report\n\n**New file:**\n\n- [REPORT.md](/bench/20260516-151352-two-turn-minmount-smoke/workspace/REPORT.md) — Documents the 2-round smoke benchmark, startup/test instructions, feature inventory, what was not done, and Round 3 suggestions\n\n## Validation Results\n\n`npm test` — **134 passed, 0 failed** (up from 87 in Round 1), covering 13 phases:\n\n| Phase | Checks | What |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1–8 | 87 | Round 1 baseline: files, server, HTML, data, business rules, CSS, security |\n| 9 | 8 | Offline compliance: no Google Fonts, no CDN, no HTTPS URLs, system font stack |\n| 10 | 13 | Round 2 HTML: tabs, panels, action list, playbook list, export, filters, script order |\n| 11 | 8 | Round 2 data: playbooks, actions, status mutations |\n| 12 | 10 | Round 2 CSS: tabs, action table, playbook cards, export |\n| 13 | 8 | REPORT.md presence and content |\n\n## First-Party Line Count\n\n2,133 lines across 10 files:\n\n| File | Lines |\n|---|---|\n| package.json | 13 |\n| server.mjs | 41 |\n| public/index.html | 112 |\n| public/css/styles.css | 546 |\n| public/js/data.js | 334 |\n| public/js/utils.js | 71 |\n| public/js/components.js | 300 |\n| public/js/app.js | 323 |\n| scripts/validate.mjs | 284 |\n| REPORT.md | 109 |\n\n## Startup\n\n```\nnpm start        →  http://localhost:5173\nnpm test         →  134 assertions, zero failures\n```\n\nThe page renders fully offline. No external fonts, CDN, or API calls. Three tabs: Dashboard (metrics, account risk list with search/filter/detail), Actions (task queue with complete/defer/undo, owner/status/domain filters, text export), Playbook (per-account risk playbooks with recommended steps, open actions, and financial impact).\n\n## Remaining Risks\n\nThe action status mutations are in-memory only — they reset on page reload. Export area toggles inline rather than triggering a file download. The playbook tab shows all high-risk accounts simultaneously; for a production benchmark, pagination or lazy loading would be needed once account count exceeds ~50.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"